        "original_id": "4057cbb1-cb52-5af0-a189-f400decab3e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maynard James Keenan, Danny Carey, Adam Jones\n- Bands: Man or Astro-man?, Tool, A Perfect Circle\n- Places: Auburn, Alabama\n- Products: The Sounds of Tomorrow\n- Companies: Estrus Records\n\nFacts:\n- Man or Astro-man? is a surf rock group that formed in Auburn, Alabama, in the early 1990s.\n- Tool formed in 1990, and its line-up includes Danny Carey, Adam Jones, and Maynard James Keenan.\n- Man or Astro-man? came to prominence over the decade following its early-1990s formation.\n- The Sounds of Tomorrow is a 7-inch EP that Estrus Records released in 1996.\n- Maynard James Keenan is the lead singer of Tool, with whom he has recorded four studio albums and earned two Grammy Awards.\n- Maynard James Keenan is also the lead singer of A Perfect Circle, with whom he has recorded three studio albums.",
